  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Mixing up your spellcasting procedures makes them more potent.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Caster level 1st or higher with at least two casting traditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you create a magic effect using a specific casting tradition, you gain a +1 bonus to your caster level for any magic effect you create using a different casting tradition until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theurge-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
